        <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:0.9rem; color:#666; margin-bottom:28px; max-width:400px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;">Our team is preparing an exciting portfolio of properties and projects. Check back soon or contact us for details.</p>
