      <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif; font-size:0.95rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65); margin-bottom:32px; max-width:480px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;">Whether you're looking to develop, invest, or acquire property — we're here to help you achieve your goals.</p>
